WEBVTT

00:00:53.121 --> 00:00:55.920
Arusu handed over the
True Book of Spells and...

00:00:56.024 --> 00:01:00.359
...tried to free the fairies that
Grande was going to use for dark magic.

00:01:00.695 --> 00:01:05.292
While they were fighting,
Wizard Kingdom began to crumble.

00:01:06.501 --> 00:01:09.527
It was there that Arusu and the
others helped the warlocks...

00:01:09.638 --> 00:01:12.266
...and escaped to Witch Heaven.

00:01:12.807 --> 00:01:17.506
But both Grande and the
True Book of Spells went missing.

00:02:47.535 --> 00:02:50.903
Tweeny Witches

00:02:55.443 --> 00:02:59.903
Demise

00:03:02.183 --> 00:03:06.450
Wizard Kingdom rejected magic
and used technology instead...

00:03:06.554 --> 00:03:09.148
...to take control of
peoples' hearts, but now...

00:03:09.257 --> 00:03:11.453
...it's gone because of the destruction.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:16.320
Do you even know where Grande is?
With all this destruction.

00:03:16.431 --> 00:03:19.423
But the True Book of Spells
is all burned up, right?

00:03:19.534 --> 00:03:21.593
It will be difficult for us to find it.

00:03:21.703 --> 00:03:23.797
Stop complaining and search!

00:03:23.872 --> 00:03:28.469
Besides, the True Book of Spells
can't be burned by flames, you know!

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:29.775
Fine!

00:03:31.146 --> 00:03:34.377
If Grande died in this destruction,
then it's safe to say...

00:03:34.482 --> 00:03:37.474
...that we no longer have to
worry about dark magic.

00:03:37.686 --> 00:03:41.589
All that remains is the sorrow
after the loss of many lives.

00:03:42.657 --> 00:03:44.625
Hey, where's my dad?

00:03:45.293 --> 00:03:47.352
Where's my dad?

00:03:47.662 --> 00:03:49.687
I'm sorry.

00:03:51.066 --> 00:03:55.196
Even though we freed
the fairies and avoided...

00:03:55.704 --> 00:03:58.196
...destruction by dark magic...

00:03:58.506 --> 00:04:02.204
...this realm is going
to disappear anyway.

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:06.679
Mother...

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:10.127
Do you want to go to Miche Village?

00:04:10.151 --> 00:04:10.845
Do you want to go to Miche Village?
What?

00:04:11.219 --> 00:04:13.244
The Witch Realm has been taken over.

00:04:13.388 --> 00:04:17.723
Plus Atelia is even
labeled as a traitor.

00:04:18.359 --> 00:04:20.726
I think this place is too dangerous.

00:04:21.029 --> 00:04:24.795
Fortunately, my mother is
in Miche Village right now.

00:04:24.999 --> 00:04:27.161
She's trustworthy, you know.

00:04:27.268 --> 00:04:29.293
I'll ask her if you two can...

00:04:29.404 --> 00:04:29.814
...live there comfortably...

00:04:29.838 --> 00:04:32.136
...live there comfortably...
That's what I was thinking of doing.

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:32.729
What?

00:04:33.875 --> 00:04:36.139
We don't have much time left.

00:04:36.244 --> 00:04:38.178
| want to make up for lost time...

00:04:38.279 --> 00:04:40.748
...by spending the
remaining moments with her.

00:04:41.082 --> 00:04:45.144
It's better if we stay away
from Arusu right now.

00:04:45.453 --> 00:04:47.080
Sorry about all this.

00:04:49.124 --> 00:04:51.388
Take care of Arusu for me.

00:04:53.294 --> 00:04:54.784
Where's Arusu?

00:04:55.764 --> 00:04:57.630
She's been like that ever since!

00:04:57.699 --> 00:04:58.928
Ever since?

00:04:59.167 --> 00:05:02.000
You've been watching her all this time?

00:05:02.203 --> 00:05:03.136
But...

00:05:03.538 --> 00:05:07.031
Friends are supposed to reach out
and help in times of suffering, right?

00:05:07.142 --> 00:05:08.940
| know that!

00:05:09.043 --> 00:05:12.479
| know that, and I feel sorry for Arusu.

00:05:13.014 --> 00:05:15.346
But I can't do anything for her!

00:05:15.617 --> 00:05:19.451
| can't use my magic, and
I'll die after losing my power.

00:05:19.554 --> 00:05:21.545
There's nothing I can do!

00:05:22.323 --> 00:05:24.690
Let's go home. You must be hungry.

00:05:24.793 --> 00:05:27.387
I'll try and make something today.

00:05:33.034 --> 00:05:34.297
Sheila.

00:05:34.636 --> 00:05:38.402
Magic is not supposed
to hurt others, right?

00:05:39.307 --> 00:05:43.403
Magic is supposed to make
everyone happy, right?

00:05:44.179 --> 00:05:44.941
Yeah.

00:05:45.814 --> 00:05:47.077
Alliance?

00:05:47.448 --> 00:05:50.076
That's what he proposes.

00:05:50.251 --> 00:05:54.347
That means you can be
in charge of this realm, boss!

00:05:54.956 --> 00:05:56.567
Never mind alliances.

00:05:56.591 --> 00:05:58.923
Never mind alliances.
I thought he was dead.

00:05:59.694 --> 00:06:01.423
Can you hear me, Arusu?

00:06:01.963 --> 00:06:02.862
Arusu?

00:06:03.364 --> 00:06:05.355
Dad! You're alive?

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:07.500
You're alive, Dad!

00:06:08.670 --> 00:06:10.468
You've grown, Arusu.

00:06:12.841 --> 00:06:16.471
Oh yeah, dad. I'm able to use magic now!

00:06:16.578 --> 00:06:18.444
| can even fly by using a broom...

00:06:18.513 --> 00:06:20.777
I know! You can join me next time and...

00:06:20.882 --> 00:06:22.111
Didn't I tell you?

00:06:22.183 --> 00:06:26.142
If you believe with all your heart,
then anyone can use magic.

00:06:26.855 --> 00:06:29.119
Now that magic has made
your dream come true...

00:06:29.224 --> 00:06:32.194
...it's time for you to
protect that magic. As a savior.

00:06:32.727 --> 00:06:35.321
Are you talking about light magic?

00:06:35.496 --> 00:06:36.691
That's right.

00:06:37.131 --> 00:06:40.567
But it wasn't even listed
in the book you gave me.

00:06:40.668 --> 00:06:44.536
Nobody knows about it.
I don't know how to use it.

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:46.401
Take a look.

00:06:50.478 --> 00:06:54.073
Even if you shine light into darkness,
it'll just be sucked up.

00:06:54.182 --> 00:06:55.013
Yeah.

00:06:58.786 --> 00:07:01.312
Try to harness the light from within.

00:07:01.456 --> 00:07:03.220
That's light magic.

00:07:05.059 --> 00:07:08.518
Don't worry, Arusu.
I'll always be by your side.

00:07:13.668 --> 00:07:14.726
A dream?

00:07:16.504 --> 00:07:18.529
This is Dad's...

00:07:23.845 --> 00:07:25.040
Mother!

00:07:25.813 --> 00:07:29.579
Looks like my powers are all gone.

00:07:31.653 --> 00:07:36.147
But this is the only thing I can do.

00:07:38.192 --> 00:07:39.637
You should be happy.

00:07:39.661 --> 00:07:40.184
You should be happy.
What?

00:07:40.561 --> 00:07:44.395
The last of your magic
is making someone happy.

00:07:48.903 --> 00:07:50.667
Thank you, Lennon.

00:08:05.086 --> 00:08:06.349
The fairies?

00:08:08.189 --> 00:08:10.851
But dark magic can't be used.

00:08:10.959 --> 00:08:12.518
He's alive.

00:08:14.762 --> 00:08:16.560
Grande's alive.

00:08:16.664 --> 00:08:20.692
Looks like he made an alliance with
Barunn and their new government.

00:08:20.802 --> 00:08:21.769
What?

00:08:22.337 --> 00:08:24.465
Then the True Book of Spells...

00:08:25.273 --> 00:08:28.971
So they were the traitors involved
with the use of dark magic...

00:08:31.012 --> 00:08:33.310
Come on. Let's go, Sheila.

00:08:33.614 --> 00:08:34.342
Arusu...

00:08:34.449 --> 00:08:35.280
Arusu.

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.551
Don't worry. I'm the saver.

00:08:39.087 --> 00:08:41.988
You mean you're the savior.

00:08:43.291 --> 00:08:45.658
That's another way of saying it!

00:08:46.661 --> 00:08:48.129
I had a dream.

00:08:48.262 --> 00:08:51.061
My dad told me about light magic.

00:08:51.399 --> 00:08:55.893
If I can make everyone
happy with light magic...

00:08:56.637 --> 00:09:00.198
...then I have a feeling
| could see my dad again.

00:09:02.377 --> 00:09:03.811
We were too late.

00:09:04.278 --> 00:09:05.109
No way!

00:09:05.513 --> 00:09:08.505
Then all the fairies are captured again?

00:09:09.817 --> 00:09:12.479
Are you the fairy from that time?

00:09:19.894 --> 00:09:22.522
We still need one more fairy?

00:09:23.297 --> 00:09:25.994
Who cares? It's only one fairy.

00:09:26.567 --> 00:09:27.728
Grande.

00:09:28.202 --> 00:09:32.867
If we can activate dark magic,
we can go to a new world.

00:09:33.041 --> 00:09:35.009
In other words, we'll be saved, right?

00:09:35.276 --> 00:09:36.334
Of course.

00:09:36.644 --> 00:09:41.013
But if we're missing even a single fairy,
dark magic can't be activated.

00:09:41.249 --> 00:09:43.718
We must find it at any cost.

00:09:44.452 --> 00:09:48.355
Listen. As long as we have the mina fairy,
they can't use dark magic.

00:09:48.456 --> 00:09:52.415
We need to find out how to use
light magic while we're stalling for time...

00:09:53.961 --> 00:09:55.156
What's wrong?

00:09:55.963 --> 00:09:57.556
I'm thinking.

00:09:57.965 --> 00:09:59.990
Sheila, that's...

00:10:01.135 --> 00:10:02.728
That's mustard.

00:10:11.012 --> 00:10:12.189
You thought of something?

00:10:12.213 --> 00:10:13.806
You thought of something?
Hey, are you hungry?

00:10:13.915 --> 00:10:15.781
We can't eat at times like these.

00:10:15.883 --> 00:10:18.318
You eat because of times like these.

00:10:18.519 --> 00:10:19.680
Hey, that's...

00:10:20.154 --> 00:10:20.712
Hot!

00:10:22.824 --> 00:10:24.656
Arusu, I'll do it.

00:10:24.759 --> 00:10:27.660
It's okay. Just sit down, Eva.

00:10:27.762 --> 00:10:29.196
Hey, Sheila.

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:31.123
Today is Eva's...

00:10:31.933 --> 00:10:32.729
Right?

00:10:34.969 --> 00:10:37.165
Happy birthday, Eva!

00:10:37.338 --> 00:10:38.237
Happy birthday!

00:10:38.406 --> 00:10:39.430
Thanks.

00:10:39.807 --> 00:10:43.141
But I can't grow up
to be an adult, and...

00:10:43.311 --> 00:10:45.905
...I can't use my magic anymore.

00:10:48.549 --> 00:10:52.508
First up is Arusu!
I'm going to sing for Eva!

00:10:53.754 --> 00:11:00.456
One day in the forest, I met Eva...

00:11:00.561 --> 00:11:07.968
On the road with lots of flowers,
ImetEva...

00:11:09.637 --> 00:11:10.399
What?

00:11:10.505 --> 00:11:11.973
It's just that...

00:11:12.406 --> 00:11:14.966
You're terrible when you sing alone.

00:11:16.644 --> 00:11:18.976
Hey, not you too, mina!

00:11:20.615 --> 00:11:21.980
This is bad!

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:24.448
They found out that
we have the mina fairy!

00:11:33.427 --> 00:11:36.419
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.968 --> 00:11:45.428
Dark Magic

00:11:49.944 --> 00:11:52.276
What should we do, Arusu?

00:11:52.413 --> 00:11:55.383
Can't you do anything about light magic?

00:11:55.483 --> 00:11:58.714
I'm thinking of a way to use it, but...

00:11:58.819 --> 00:12:01.220
The destruction is upon us, you know!

00:12:02.023 --> 00:12:05.049
See? You always do that
with your eyebrows!

00:12:05.159 --> 00:12:07.628
If you rush things, then you're
no different than they are!

00:12:07.728 --> 00:12:10.993
We should just relax and
take it real easy for now.

00:12:14.001 --> 00:12:14.797
Eva!

00:12:19.407 --> 00:12:21.273
Dragon House, right?

00:12:30.418 --> 00:12:33.353
Hey, can't you do anything with magic?

00:12:33.754 --> 00:12:37.315
Because of the destruction,
her powers are getting weaker.

00:12:37.425 --> 00:12:38.969
We can't do anything with magic...

00:12:38.993 --> 00:12:41.087
We can't do anything with magic...
I'll look up the healing spell!

00:12:41.195 --> 00:12:41.855
Arusu.

00:12:41.963 --> 00:12:43.556
What is it, Sheila?

00:12:43.664 --> 00:12:44.859
I'm going too!

00:12:45.266 --> 00:12:46.358
Sheila...

00:12:47.068 --> 00:12:48.433
Don't worry...

00:12:48.536 --> 00:12:49.298
What?

00:12:50.705 --> 00:12:52.366
I'll be fine...

00:12:53.007 --> 00:12:53.906
So...

00:12:54.008 --> 00:12:54.600
But...

00:12:54.709 --> 00:12:59.112
So get the magic of light
to work, Arusu.

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:02.943
Protect the mina fairy, Sheila.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:07.385
We will, but before we do,
you have to get better, Eva.

00:13:07.488 --> 00:13:08.649
Please!

00:13:10.391 --> 00:13:13.884
| can't use my magic anymore...

00:13:16.664 --> 00:13:20.726
I don't want to be a
nuisance to both of you!

00:13:21.002 --> 00:13:21.969
Eva...

00:13:24.171 --> 00:13:28.074
Even if you shine light into darkness,
it'll just be sucked up.

00:13:28.409 --> 00:13:29.553
What about an incantation?

00:13:29.577 --> 00:13:31.121
What about an incantation?
Try to harness the light from within.

00:13:31.145 --> 00:13:32.635
Try to harness the light from within.

00:13:33.247 --> 00:13:35.238
That's light magic.

00:13:35.349 --> 00:13:38.842
What do you need from the fairies
in order to use magic?

00:13:38.986 --> 00:13:43.048
If you believe with all your heart,
then anyone can use magic.

00:13:43.958 --> 00:13:44.925
Dad...

00:13:46.527 --> 00:13:50.088
I don't care if it's the
magic of light or garlic of fight.

00:13:50.197 --> 00:13:53.030
If you just keep giving
half-baked opinions and can't...

00:13:53.134 --> 00:13:55.330
...do anything, then what's the point?

00:13:56.137 --> 00:13:58.936
You just watch the realm come to an end?

00:13:59.473 --> 00:14:03.933
Do you want to take a chance
and activate dark magic?

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:08.442
No matter what you do,
we can only choose one.

00:14:08.683 --> 00:14:10.947
That's called reality!

00:14:11.919 --> 00:14:16.481
You can't do anything
but see this realm come to an end.

00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:19.958
You people don't have any right
to get in our way!

00:14:20.094 --> 00:14:24.964
Now hand over the mina fairy
to us at once!

00:14:28.569 --> 00:14:30.765
We can't do anything about it...

00:14:32.006 --> 00:14:32.802
Eva!

00:14:34.075 --> 00:14:37.568
How long do we have
until this place is destroyed?

00:14:39.113 --> 00:14:40.911
It's only a matter of time.

00:14:41.015 --> 00:14:44.781
It's likely that the
next tremor will be the last.

00:14:45.286 --> 00:14:47.030
Damn! I can't wait any longer!

00:14:47.054 --> 00:14:48.681
Damn! I can't wait any longer!
Fine.

00:14:49.357 --> 00:14:50.950
Listen up!

00:14:51.125 --> 00:14:52.889
We'll wait ten more minutes!

00:14:52.993 --> 00:14:56.952
If you don't hand over the mina fairy
by then, we're storming in!

00:14:57.131 --> 00:14:58.963
But then the mina fairy might...

00:14:59.066 --> 00:15:01.763
We don't even know
if dark magic will work.

00:15:01.869 --> 00:15:06.534
Even if the mina fairy dies,
don't you think it's still worth doing it?

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:09.968
Well?

00:15:11.145 --> 00:15:12.977
I might not make it.

00:15:13.381 --> 00:15:16.976
| can't even save Eva, and
I'm supposed to be the savior?

00:15:17.084 --> 00:15:18.984
It's not like you.

00:15:20.388 --> 00:15:21.480
Sorry.

00:15:21.889 --> 00:15:27.350
Come to think of it, this fairy is
the one who brought us together.

00:15:27.461 --> 00:15:28.986
What? Oh, yeah.

00:15:29.296 --> 00:15:32.891
At first, I didn't really
like you at all.

00:15:33.601 --> 00:15:37.162
I thought we had the
Curse of Eternal Youth cast on us...

00:15:37.271 --> 00:15:38.932
...because of you.

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:42.742
Even when I found out about the
destruction, I thought I could escape...

00:15:42.843 --> 00:15:45.005
.if I didn't have
this curse cast on me.

00:15:45.246 --> 00:15:49.205
But after seeing the reaction of
the adults when they found out...

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:53.143
...about the destruction,
| didn't feel the same way.

00:15:53.521 --> 00:15:54.613
You didn't?

00:15:55.356 --> 00:15:59.156
Eva and I had the
Curse of Eternal Youth cast on us.

00:15:59.593 --> 00:16:03.029
We were both kids all along.
That's why we we're able to believe...

00:16:03.097 --> 00:16:07.432
...in this miracle of magic that you
kept talking about at times like this.

00:16:07.735 --> 00:16:11.399
That's why we can also believe in this
never-before-seen light magic as well.

00:16:12.106 --> 00:16:13.631
| can say this now.

00:16:13.808 --> 00:16:18.041
I'm glad we had the
Curse of Eternal Youth cast on us.

00:16:20.648 --> 00:16:21.945
Sheila.

00:16:22.216 --> 00:16:23.513
Let's surrender.

00:16:23.951 --> 00:16:26.045
We can't save Eva like this.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:26.712
What?

00:16:27.121 --> 00:16:30.056
Don't worry. I know you can do it.

00:16:31.692 --> 00:16:34.923
You can make everyone happy
with the magic of light.

00:16:35.529 --> 00:16:38.988
You say you're not made to be a savior.

00:16:39.333 --> 00:16:43.065
But you're already a savior in my eyes.

00:16:43.971 --> 00:16:46.372
That's right, Arusu.

00:16:47.608 --> 00:16:48.439
Eva.

00:16:49.443 --> 00:16:51.878
You'll be fine... I'm sure of it...

00:16:53.547 --> 00:16:56.676
That's because you're Arusu...

00:17:03.991 --> 00:17:06.892
| believe in you.

00:17:07.761 --> 00:17:10.423
| believe in you, Arusu.

00:17:15.336 --> 00:17:16.804
Thanks...

00:17:31.385 --> 00:17:32.409
Time's up.

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:33.214
Wait!

00:17:42.162 --> 00:17:43.994
Is that the last one?

00:17:50.371 --> 00:17:51.133
Hurry!

00:17:51.238 --> 00:17:53.969
Deliver this to Grande
as soon as possible!

00:17:54.942 --> 00:17:58.845
I'm surprised to see you're obedient.
I'll let you go this time.

00:18:00.014 --> 00:18:02.676
It's not like we're giving up.

00:18:03.684 --> 00:18:07.712
We're just going to surrender now
in order to see another sunrise.

00:18:07.821 --> 00:18:08.344
Yeah...

00:18:08.923 --> 00:18:12.689
If each and every one of us does
our job, I'm sure we'll be just fine.

00:18:13.093 --> 00:18:13.855
Yeah...

00:18:14.595 --> 00:18:19.032
Then let's all try to meet here
tomorrow morning, okay?

00:18:19.133 --> 00:18:19.861
Yeah!

00:18:24.371 --> 00:18:28.274
If I go to the center of destruction,
the Sanctuary, I might find out something.

00:18:30.744 --> 00:18:34.146
The light of hope can only
be seen when you look up...

00:18:34.315 --> 00:18:36.977
...from the very bottom of despair.

00:18:38.919 --> 00:18:39.943
I---

00:18:40.354 --> 00:18:43.790
You want to use your magic again, right?

00:18:43.924 --> 00:18:44.914
Can |I?

00:18:45.359 --> 00:18:46.849
Of course.

00:18:49.997 --> 00:18:53.262
If each and every one of us
does our job...

00:19:19.593 --> 00:19:21.925
How did you get here so fast?

00:19:22.062 --> 00:19:24.895
The True Book of Spells and
the 100 fairy species alone...

00:19:24.999 --> 00:19:26.933
...can't activate dark magic.

00:19:28.335 --> 00:19:29.825
| already know.

00:19:29.937 --> 00:19:33.532
Dark magic can't be activated
without the double-crossing...

00:19:33.641 --> 00:19:35.405
...witch who can use it.

00:19:35.643 --> 00:19:39.204
And I know you witches are the traitors!

00:19:40.614 --> 00:19:41.410
What?

00:19:41.682 --> 00:19:44.117
Was dark magic activated?

00:19:44.218 --> 00:19:48.121
That's because we're not the traitors.

00:19:48.989 --> 00:19:50.923
Then who?

00:19:51.625 --> 00:19:55.061
A witch who can activate dark magic...

00:19:55.763 --> 00:19:58.698
...has darkness in her heart.

00:20:03.604 --> 00:20:06.835
Well, you see, she said she wanted
to try flying, and besides...

00:20:06.907 --> 00:20:08.739
...she gave me a chestnut...

00:20:17.885 --> 00:20:25.849
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:26.026 --> 00:20:34.026
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:35.269 --> 00:20:43.269
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:44.478 --> 00:20:50.042
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:54.417
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:55.155 --> 00:20:59.388
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:59.493 --> 00:21:04.090
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:04.298 --> 00:21:09.464
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:12.631
Let's hope it does.

00:21:14.208 --> 00:21:18.702
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:18.812 --> 00:21:21.304
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:21.415 --> 00:21:29.415
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:30.624 --> 00:21:36.324
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:40.628
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
